<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS-DAY ONE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS-DAY ONE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round women's singles</p>
<p>results at the Wimbledon tennis championships on Monday (prefix</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>4-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Mariana Diaz Oliva (Argentina) 2-6</p>
<p>6-0 6-3</p>
<p>12-Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat Henrieta Nagyova (Slovakia) 6-1</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>Magdalena Maleeva (Bulgaria) beat Julie Pullin (Britain) 6-1</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Gala Leon Garcia (Spain) beat Mana Endo (Japan) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Cristina Torrens-Valero (Spain) beat Gloria Pizzichini (Italy)</p>
<p>1-6 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Denisa Chladkova (Czech Republic) beat Sandra Kleinova (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 7-6 (7-5) 6-4</p>
<p>5-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Tami Jones (U.S.) 5-7  6-2 6-2</p>
<p>UNFINISHED</p>
<p>6-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) level 6-6 with Alexandra Fusai</p>
<p>(France)</p>
<p>13-Kimberly Po (U.S.) leads Kerry-Anne Guse (Australia) 6-3 4-4</p>
<p>Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) leads Ai Sugiyama (Japan) 6-3</p>
<p>Elena Makarova (Russia) leads Tatiana Panova (Russia) 6-4 1-1</p>
<p>Marion Maruska (Austria) leads Adriana Gersi (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>7-6 3-2</p>
</text>
